
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Kazi Online Jobs</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      background: #f3f6fa;
      color: #222;
    }
    header {
      background: #087443;
      color: white;
      padding: 22px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav {
      background: #075b36;
      padding: 14px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      margin: 0 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 25px auto;
      padding: 15px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px #00000012;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #087443;
      color: white;
      padding: 11px 18px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #075b36;
      color: white;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Kazi Online Jobs</h1>
    <p>Discover opportunities. Build your future.</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#jobs">Jobs</a>
    <a href="#tasks">Tasks</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
  </nav>

  <main id="home">
    <section class="card">
      <h2>Welcome to Kazi Online Jobs</h2>
      <p>Explore job opportunities and online tasks in one place.</p>
      <a class="button" href="#jobs">Explore Jobs</a>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="jobs">
      <h2>Latest Jobs</h2>
      <p>Job opportunities will appear here as they are added.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="tasks">
      <h2>Online Tasks</h2>
      <p>Find simple tasks posted by verified clients.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="about">
      <h2>About Us</h2>
      <p>Our goal is to connect people with genuine work opportunities.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Kazi Online Jobs</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
